{"version":1,"content":"<p>因應超強颱風「薔琵」發展情況，浙江海事局今日（21日）上午8時啟動3級颱風應急響應。</p><p>省內已有36條客運航線因大風停航，223個水上施工項目全部停工。</p><p>當地海事部門已累計發布預警信息6.1萬條，點驗船舶2.3萬艘次。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:39:38.941355+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:42:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T11:57:48.856179+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:37:35.473874+00:00","content_hash":"d5cdb53602474aac5a8f3192fc0a0df155381788c9d4c9d507bc02c5cbba1ae2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}